Your profile - the details tools pre-fill

00:13:06.456 --> 00:13:09.102
from, and how to carry them between

00:13:09.148 --> 00:13:10.544
devices.

00:13:11.318 --> 00:13:14.351
Import a design - bring in your Figma /

00:13:14.412 --> 00:13:18.530
Penpot / Illustrator / InDesign work, and

00:13:18.591 --> 00:13:21.213
your PowerPoint decks - edited or

00:13:21.275 --> 00:13:23.420
rebranded on-device.

00:13:24.186 --> 00:13:26.665
Working together - two people editing one

00:13:26.753 --> 00:13:30.196
session live, device to device, with no

00:13:30.256 --> 00:13:33.120
account and no server in the middle.

00:13:33.917 --> 00:13:36.077
Search - one field at the foot of the

00:13:36.154 --> 00:13:38.938
gallery, Utilities, Projects, the

00:13:39.002 --> 00:13:41.937
Catalogue, the Dashboard and Profile that

00:13:41.998 --> 00:13:44.834
reaches your tools, your saved work, the

00:13:44.897 --> 00:13:47.344
catalogue and your settings.

00:13:47.725 --> 00:13:58.050
Ask Lolly «#/ask» - type a question and get the matching section of these guides back verbatim, with a link straight to it.

